      <view class="tip">固定资产折旧（在用 {{asset_rows.length}} 台：原值合计 {{asset_cost_total}}，每月折旧 {{asset_monthly}}，现在值 {{asset_net}}）</view>
      <view class="aline warn" wx:if="{{asset_sold_count>0}}">已处置 {{asset_sold_count}} 台，卖了 {{asset_sold_amount}}，{{asset_sold_gain>=0 ? '合计赚 ' : '合计亏 '}}{{asset_sold_gain>=0 ? asset_sold_gain : -asset_sold_gain}} 元（折旧已停）</view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="设备名称，如 数控车床" value="{{asset_name}}" bindinput="onAssetName"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="原值（买入价）" type="digit" value="{{asset_cost}}" bindinput="onAssetCost"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="买入日期，如 2025-06-01" value="{{asset_buy}}" bindinput="onAssetBuy"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="用几年（不填=5 年）" type="digit" value="{{asset_life}}" bindinput="onAssetLife"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="残值率 %（不填=5）" type="digit" value="{{asset_res}}" bindinput="onAssetRes"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="addAsset">加一台设备</button>
      <button class="btn-ghost" size="mini" bindtap="runDepreciation">立即计提本月折旧（记一笔支出）</button>
      <view class="tip">直线法：每月折旧 =（原值 − 残值）÷ 使用月数；计提后才进成本，不点就不会自动扣。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="list" wx:if="{{asset_rows.length}}">
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{asset_rows}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.name}}</text><text class="amt">净值 ¥{{item.net}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">原值 {{item.cost}} · 月折旧 {{item.monthly}} · 已折 {{item.used_months}} 个月{{item.done ? ' · 已折完' : ' · 还剩 ' + item.remain_months + ' 个月'}}</view>
        <view class="row2" wx:if="{{item.disposed}}">已处置（{{item.disposed_at}}）卖了 {{item.dispose_amount}} 元，{{item.gain>=0 ? '赚' : '亏'}} {{item.gain>=0 ? item.gain : -item.gain}} 元</view>
        <view class="btns">
          <button size="mini" wx:if="{{!item.disposed && role!='staff'}}" bindtap="disposeAsset" data-id="{{item.id}}">卖掉/报废</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="delAsset" data-id="{{item.id}}">删</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">银行流水对账（把银行卡/微信账单粘进来，再一笔笔认领成账）</view>
      <textarea class="restore-ta" placeholder="{{bank_hint}}" value="{{bank_text}}" bindinput="onBankText"></textarea>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="importBank">导入流水</button>
      <view class="duesoon" wx:if="{{bank_unmatched.count>0}}">{{bank_unmatched.count}} 笔还没认领，合计 ¥{{bank_unmatched.amount}}</view>
      <view class="tip">认领＝把这笔钱记到账上（抵某张应收/应付，或当成一笔支出），重复的点会提示。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="list" wx:if="{{bank_rows.length}}">
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{bank_rows}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.direction=='in' ? '收' : '付'}} · {{item.memo}}</text><text class="amt {{item.direction=='in' ? 'ok' : 'out'}}">¥{{item.amount}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">{{item.date}}</view>
        <view class="btns">
          <button size="mini" wx:if="{{item.direction=='in'}}" bindtap="matchBankOrder" data-id="{{item.id}}">抵应收</button>
          <button size="mini" wx:if="{{item.direction=='out'}}" bindtap="matchBankPayable" data-id="{{item.id}}">抵应付</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="matchBankExpense" data-id="{{item.id}}">记成一笔账</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="delBankFlow" data-id="{{item.id}}">删</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">坏账核销记录（本月要不回来的 {{wf_bad}} 元 · 供应商免掉的 {{wf_waived}} 元）</view>
      <view class="tip">核销只是把这笔往来抹掉，不动现金、不算收支；核销错了可以撤销。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="list" wx:if="{{wf_rows.length}}">
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{wf_rows}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.ref_type=='order' ? '应收核销' : '应付核销'}} · {{item.party}}</text><text class="amt red">¥{{item.amount}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">{{item.reason}} · {{item.created_at}}</view>
        <view class="btns"><button size="mini" bindtap="undoWriteoff" data-id="{{item.id}}">撤销</button></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">报表抬头（写厂名，图片更像正式对账单）</view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="厂名，如 兴旺五金加工厂" value="{{head_title}}" bindinput="onHeadTitle"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="备注，如 账期：当月 1 日至月底" value="{{head_note}}" bindinput="onHeadNote"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="厂里电话（打印版对账单会印上）" value="{{head_phone}}" bindinput="onHeadPhone"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="厂里地址（打印版对账单会印上）" value="{{head_addr}}" bindinput="onHeadAddr"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="收款信息，如 农行 6228…  张三" value="{{head_bank}}" bindinput="onHeadBank"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="saveHead">保存抬头</button>
      <view class="tip">催款门槛：只把「欠满 N 天」的家列进催款清单（填 0 = 全都列）</view>
      <input class="inp" type="number" placeholder="默认 0" value="{{collect_min}}" bindinput="onCollectMin"/>
      <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="saveCollectConfig">保存催款门槛</button>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">到期微信提醒（可选）：配好后，每天早上 9 点如果 7 天内有该收/该付的款，会自动给你发一条微信服务通知。微信这个功能免费。</view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="小程序 AppID（wx 开头）" value="{{wx_appid}}" bindinput="onWxAppid"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="小程序 AppSecret（只存服务器，不显示）" value="{{wx_secret}}" bindinput="onWxSecret"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="订阅消息模板ID（公众平台复制）" value="{{wx_tpl}}" bindinput="onWxTpl"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="模板字段（默认 thing1,time2,thing3，不用改）" value="{{wx_fields}}" bindinput="onWxFields"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="saveWx">保存配置</button>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="enableWx">开启微信提醒（要我手机上点允许）</button>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="testWx">发一条测试通知</button>
      <view class="tip" wx:if="{{wx_info}}">已登记 {{wx_info.users}} 个微信，剩余可推 {{wx_info.quota}} 条{{wx_info.has_secret?'':'（还没存 AppSecret）'}}</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:if="{{tab=='flows'}}">
    <view class="form">
      <input class="inp" placeholder="月份，如 2026-11（不填=全部）" value="{{flows_month}}" bindinput="onFlowsMonth"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="搜分类/备注/账户，如 房租" value="{{flows_kw}}" bindinput="onFlowsKw" bindconfirm="loadFlows"/>
      <view class="chips">
        <view class="seg {{flows_dir==''?'on':''}}" bindtap="setFlowsDir" data-d="">全部</view>
        <view class="seg {{flows_dir=='in'?'on':''}}" bindtap="setFlowsDir" data-d="in">只看收</view>
        <view class="seg {{flows_dir=='out'?'on':''}}" bindtap="setFlowsDir" data-d="out">只看付</view>
        <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="loadFlows">查一下</button>
      </view>
      <view class="tip" wx:if="{{flows}}">共 {{flows.count}} 笔　收 {{flows.total_in}}　付 {{flows.total_out}}　结余 {{flows.net}}{{flows.tip ? '　' + flows.tip : ''}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{flows && flows.by_cat.length}}">
        <view class="plrow" wx:for="{{flows.by_cat}}" wx:key="name">
          <text class="pll">{{item.name}}</text><text class="plv">{{item.amount}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="list" wx:if="{{flows}}">
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{flows.rows}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1">
          <text class="nm">{{item.date}} · {{item.dir_text}} {{item.amount}}</text>
          <text class="amt {{item.dir=='in'?'ok':'red'}}">{{item.dir=='in'?'+':'-'}}{{item.amount}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row2">{{item.cat_text}}{{item.remark ? ' · ' + item.remark : ''}} · {{item.account}}{{item.ref_text ? ' · ' + item.ref_text : ''}}</view>
        <view class="frow">
          <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="delFlow" data-id="{{item.id}}">删</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!flows.rows.length}}">{{flows.tip || '这个范围没有流水'}}</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:if="{{tab=='history'}}">
    <view class="form">
      <view class="seg {{history_type=='ar'?'on':''}}" bindtap="setHistoryType" data-t="ar">已收完的应收</view>
      <view class="seg {{history_type=='ap'?'on':''}}" bindtap="setHistoryType" data-t="ap">已付完的应付</view>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{history_type=='ar'}}">
      <view class="list">
        <view class="item" wx:for="{{history_ar_list}}" wx:key="id">
          <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.customer}} · {{item.item_name}}</text><text class="amt ok">{{item.settle}}</text></view>
          <view class="row2">结清 · {{item.created_at}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!history_ar_list.length}}">暂无已结清应收</view>
      </view>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="list">
        <view class="item" wx:for="{{history_ap_list}}" wx:key="id">
          <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.supplier}}</text><text class="amt ok">{{item.settle}}</text></view>
          <view class="row2">{{item.remark}} · 结清 · {{item.created_at}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!history_ap_list.length}}">暂无已结清应付</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </block>

  <block wx:if="{{tab=='contact'}}">
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">默认账期（不单独设的单位都按这个算，比如 30 天；设了以后新单自动带出到期日）</view>
      <view class="frow">
        <input class="inp" placeholder="默认账期天数，0=不设" type="number" value="{{term_default}}" bindinput="onTermDefault"/>
        <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="saveTermDefault">保存默认账期</button>
      </view>
      <view class="tip">账期与对账周期（设了以后建单自动算到期日，到日子自动提醒你去对账）</view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="单位名（客户或供应商）" value="{{term_party}}" bindinput="onTermParty"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="账期天数：月结 30 天就填 30（0=不设）" type="number" value="{{term_days}}" bindinput="onTermDays"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="多久对一次账：30=每月，90=每季（0=不提醒）" type="number" value="{{term_cycle}}" bindinput="onTermCycle"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="每月几号发对账单：15=每月15号（0=不设，1-28）" type="number" value="{{term_day}}" bindinput="onTermDay"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="saveTerm">保存账期</button>
      <view class="frow">
        <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="loadReconCal">📅 对账日历</button>
        <text class="tip" wx:if="{{rc}}">{{rc.advice}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{rc}}">
        <view class="item" wx:for="{{rc.rows}}" wx:key="party">
          <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.party}}</text><text class="amt {{item.state==='sent'?'ok':(item.state==='today'?'red':'warn')}}">{{item.state_text}}</text></view>
          <view class="row2">约定每月 {{item.day}} 号 · 现在欠 ¥{{item.left}}{{item.sent_at ? ' · 本月已发 ' + item.sent_at.slice(5) : ''}}</view>
          <view class="btns" wx:if="{{item.state!=='sent'}}">
            <button size="mini" bindtap="logStatementManual" data-p="{{item.party}}" data-k="{{item.kind}}">📄 发好了，记一笔</button>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="frow"><button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="closeReconCal">收起</button></view>
        <view class="tip">到点没发的首页会提醒；发完用「📄 发好了，记一笔」登记，日历上就变成本月已发。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{terms}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.party}}</text><text class="amt {{item.recon_due?'red':''}}">{{item.due_text}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">{{item.kind_text}} · {{item.term_text}} · {{item.cycle_text}} · 欠{{item.ar_left>0?item.ar_left:item.ap_left}} · 最久{{item.oldest_days}}天</view>
        <view class="btns">
          <button size="mini" bindtap="editTerm" data-i="{{index}}">改</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="applyTerm" data-i="{{index}}">补到期日</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="delTerm" data-i="{{index}}">删</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip" wx:if="{{terms_unset.length}}">还没设账期但有欠款：<text wx:for="{{terms_unset}}" wx:key="party" class="red" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="pickUnsetParty">{{item.party}} </text>——点名字自动填到上面</view>
      <view class="tip">「补到期日」= 给这家现有还没结完的单，按账期天数补上到期日（这样首页 7 天内到期提醒才准）。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">🔀 合并重名 / 改名（同一家被记成两个名字，对账就永远对不上）</view>
      <view class="frow">
        <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="loadPartyDups">🔀 查有没有重名</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" wx:if="{{pdup}}" bindtap="closePartyDups">收起</button>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{pdup}}">
        <view class="tip">{{pdup.advice}}</view>
        <view class="item" wx:for="{{pdup.groups}}" wx:key="key">
          <view class="row1"><text class="nm">看着是同一家</text><text class="amt">{{item.names.length}} 种写法</text></view>
          <view class="row2">用这套名字记账，建议统一成「{{item.keep}}」</view>
          <view class="btns">
            <block wx:for="{{item.names}}" wx:for-item="nm" wx:key="*this">
              <button size="mini" wx:if="{{nm!==item.keep}}" bindtap="mergeInto" data-from="{{nm}}" data-to="{{item.keep}}">「{{nm}}」并到「{{item.keep}}」</button>
            </block>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="frow">
          <input class="inp" placeholder="原来的名字" value="{{pm_from}}" bindinput="onPmFrom"/>
          <input class="inp" placeholder="改成的名字（已有的名字=合并）" value="{{pm_to}}" bindinput="onPmTo"/>
        </view>
        <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="doPartyMerge">改名/合并</button>
      </view>
      <view class="tip">往来单位档案（填了电话就能一键拨号催款，对账单也能带抬头）{{profiles.length ? '　共 '+profiles.length+' 家' : ''}}</view>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="loadProfiles">读取档案</button>
      <view wx:if="{{profile_edit}}">
        <view class="tip">正在改：{{pf_party}}</view>
        <input class="inp" placeholder="联系人" value="{{pf_contact}}" bindinput="onPfContact"/>
        <input class="inp" placeholder="电话" type="text" value="{{pf_phone}}" bindinput="onPfPhone"/>
        <input class="inp" placeholder="地址" value="{{pf_addr}}" bindinput="onPfAddr"/>
        <input class="inp" placeholder="备注（开票信息、习惯付款日等）" value="{{pf_note}}" bindinput="onPfNote"/>
        <view class="frow">
          <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="saveProfile">保存</button>
          <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="closeProfile">取消</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{profiles}}" wx:key="party">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.party}}{{item.kind=='ap'?'（供应商）':''}}</text><text class="amt {{item.left>0?'red':'ok'}}">欠 {{item.left}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">{{item.phone ? item.phone : '还没填电话'}}{{item.contact ? ' · ' + item.contact : ''}}{{item.addr ? ' · ' + item.addr : ''}}</view>
        <view class="row2" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
        <view class="row2" wx:if="{{item.sent_times}}">📄 已发对账单 {{item.sent_times}} 次（上次 {{item.sent_last}}{{item.sent_days!==null ? '，' + item.sent_days + ' 天前' : ''}}）</view>
        <view class="btns">
          <button size="mini" bindtap="callParty" data-ph="{{item.phone}}">📞 打电话</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="logStatementManual" data-p="{{item.party}}" data-k="{{item.kind}}">📄 记发对账单</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="openStLog" data-p="{{item.party}}">📄 送达/回音</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="openProfile" data-p="{{item.party}}">改档案</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="openCustCard" data-p="{{item.party}}">📇 画像</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form" wx:if="{{st_log}}">
      <view class="tip">对账单送达与回音 · {{st_log.party}}　共 {{st_log.count}} 份</view>
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{st_log.rows}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.date}}{{item.month ? ' · ' + item.month + ' 月账单' : ''}}</text><text class="amt {{item.no_reply?'red':'ok'}}">{{item.ack_text}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">方式：{{item.channel}}{{item.ack_at ? '　回音：' + item.ack_at.slice(0,10) : ''}}{{item.note ? '　' + item.note : ''}}</view>
        <view class="btns">
          <button size="mini" bindtap="ackSt" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-ack="ok">✓ 对方确认了</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="ackSt" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-ack="doubt">? 有异议</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="delSt" data-id="{{item.id}}">删</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="frow"><button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="closeStLog">收起</button></view>
      <view class="tip">发出去 7 天没回音的，首页会提醒你；点「有异议」会自动记一笔催款，免得忘了。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="form" wx:if="{{pbal}}">
      <view class="tip">一句话对账 · {{pbal.party}}（{{pbal.type=='ar'?'应收':'应付'}}）</view>
      <view class="pbtext">{{pbal.text}}</view>
      <view class="frow">
        <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="copyPartyBalance">复制这段话</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="partyBalanceDetail">看往来明细</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="closePartyBalance">收起</button>
      </view>
      <view class="tip">直接发微信给对方：「你说的总数我算了一下」，有争议的对方一看就知道是哪一笔。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="form" wx:if="{{cc}}">
      <view class="tip">📇 客户画像 · {{cc.party}}</view>
      <view class="cc-verdict {{cc.tone}}">{{cc.verdict}}</view>
      <view class="cc-grid">
        <view class="cc-k">做了 <text class="cc-v">{{cc.cnt}}</text> 单</view>
        <view class="cc-k">合计 <text class="cc-v">¥{{cc.income}}</text></view>
        <view class="cc-k">料钱 <text class="cc-v">¥{{cc.cost}}</text></view>
        <view class="cc-k">毛利 <text class="cc-v">¥{{cc.profit}}（{{cc.margin_pct}}%）</text></view>
        <view class="cc-k">单均 <text class="cc-v">¥{{cc.avg_per_order}}</text></view>
        <view class="cc-k">付款速度 <text class="cc-v">{{cc.pay.avg_days===null?'还没结清过':cc.pay.avg_days+' 天'}}</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="row2" wx:if="{{cc.pay.avg_days!==null}}">最快 {{cc.pay.fastest}} 天、最慢 {{cc.pay.slowest}} 天，按 {{cc.pay.settled_cnt}} 单已结清的算</view>
      <view class="row2">现在欠 ¥{{cc.unpaid}}{{cc.oldest_days?'，最老一笔 '+cc.oldest_days+' 天':''}}{{cc.overdue_cnt?'，'+cc.overdue_cnt+' 笔已过期':''}}</view>
      <view class="row2" wx:if="{{cc.dun_times||cc.statements}}">催过 {{cc.dun_times}} 次、发过 {{cc.statements}} 份对账单{{cc.disputes?'，'+cc.disputes+' 份有争议':''}}</view>
      <view class="cc-adv" wx:for="{{cc.advice}}" wx:key="*this">· {{item}}</view>
      <view class="frow">
        <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="copyCustCard">复制这张卡</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" bindtap="openStatementFromCard">发对账单</button>
        <button class="btn gray" size="mini" bindtap="closeCustCard">收起</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">资金账户（手头现金合计 ¥{{cash_balance}}）</view>
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{accounts}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.name}}{{item.id==acc_id?'（默认）':''}}</text><text class="amt {{item.balance<0?'red':''}}">¥{{item.balance}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">期初{{item.opening}} · 进{{item.in}} · 出{{item.out}}</view>
        <view class="btns">
          <button size="mini" wx:if="{{item.id!=acc_id}}" bindtap="setDefaultAcc" data-i="{{index}}">设为默认</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="editOpening" data-id="{{item.id}}">改期初</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="renameAccount" data-id="{{item.id}}">改名</button>
          <button size="mini" bindtap="delAccount" data-id="{{item.id}}">删</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="新账户名，如 农行卡 / 微信零钱" value="{{new_acc_name}}" bindinput="onNewAccName"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="这个账户期初有多少钱(可不填)" type="digit" value="{{new_acc_opening}}" bindinput="onNewAccOpening"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="addAccount">加一个账户</button>
      <view class="tip">期初余额 = 你开始用这个软件时，这个账户里本来有多少钱</view>
      <view class="hobtns">
        <button class="btn gray" size="mini" bindtap="openAccRecon">🧾 钱进了哪个口袋（对一下）</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form" wx:if="{{ar2}}">
      <view class="rec-t">🧾 {{ar2.label}} 收付对照</view>
      <view class="ag-tabs">
        <text class="ag-tab {{ar2.mode=='day'?'on':''}}" bindtap="accReconDay">今天</text>
        <text class="ag-tab {{ar2.mode=='month'?'on':''}}" bindtap="accReconMonth">这个月</text>
      </view>
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{ar2.rows}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.name}}</text><text class="amt {{item.balance<0?'red':''}}">余额 ¥{{item.balance}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">收 ¥{{item.income}}（{{item.in_n}} 笔） · 付 ¥{{item.outcome}}（{{item.out_n}} 笔） · 净 {{item.net}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="item" wx:if="{{ar2.no_acc.n>0}}">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">没记是哪个账户</text><text class="amt warnc">{{ar2.no_acc.n}} 笔</text></view>
        <view class="row2">收 ¥{{ar2.no_acc.in}} · 付 ¥{{ar2.no_acc.out}}（先算进第一个账户了）</view>
      </view>
      <view class="row1"><text class="nm">合计</text><text class="amt">收 ¥{{ar2.total_in}} · 付 ¥{{ar2.total_out}}</text></view>
      <view class="ag-tip" wx:for="{{ar2.issues}}" wx:key="*this">{{item.tone=='bad'?'⚠ ':'· '}}{{item.text}}</view>
      <view class="tip" wx:if="{{ar2.issues.length==0}}">各账户都对得上 ✓</view>
      <view class="hobtns">
        <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="copyAccRecon">复制这段</button>
        <button class="btn gray" size="mini" bindtap="closeAccRecon">收起</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">账户内部转账（现金存银行、微信提现，不算收入也不算支出）</view>
      <picker range="{{acc_names}}" bindchange="onTrFrom"><view class="picker">从：{{tr_from>=0 ? acc_names[tr_from] : '选转出账户'}} ▾</view></picker>
      <picker range="{{acc_names}}" bindchange="onTrTo"><view class="picker">到：{{tr_to>=0 ? acc_names[tr_to] : '选转入账户'}} ▾</view></picker>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="转账金额" type="digit" value="{{tr_amount}}" bindinput="onTrAmount"/>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="备注，如 现金存银行（可不填）" value="{{tr_remark}}" bindinput="onTrRemark"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="addTransfer">转一笔</button>
    </view>
    <view class="list" wx:if="{{tr_rows.length}}">
      <view class="item" wx:for="{{tr_rows}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.from_name}} → {{item.to_name}}</text><text class="amt">¥{{item.amount}}</text></view>
        <view class="row2">{{item.created_at}}{{item.remark ? ' · ' + item.remark : ''}}</view>
        <view class="btns"><button size="mini" bindtap="delTransfer" data-id="{{item.id}}">删</button></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">支出 / 收入分类（可自己加，报表和预算按分类统计）</view>
      <view class="chips">
        <text class="chip-label">支出类：</text>
        <text class="chip" wx:for="{{cats_out}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="delCategory" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.name}} ✕</text>
      </view>
      <view class="chips">
        <text class="chip-label">收入类：</text>
        <text class="chip" wx:for="{{cats_in}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="delCategory" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.name}} ✕</text>
      </view>
      <picker range="{{['支出类', '收入类']}}" bindchange="onNewCatType"><view class="picker">加到：{{new_cat_type ? '收入类' : '支出类'}} ▾</view></picker>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="新分类名，如 包装 / 快递" value="{{new_cat_name}}" bindinput="onNewCatName"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="addCategory">加分类</button>
      <view class="tip">点分类名可删除（已用过的历史记录不受影响）</view>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="tip">账套（两厂/两车间分开核算，数据互不影响）</view>
      <view class="list">
        <view class="item" wx:for="{{books}}" wx:key="id">
          <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.name}}{{item.id==book?'（当前）':''}}</text><text class="amt">欠{{item.ar}}</text></view>
          <view class="row2">应收单 {{item.orders}} 张</view>
          <view class="btns">
            <button size="mini" wx:if="{{item.id!=book}}" bindtap="switchBook" data-id="{{item.id}}">切换到这套</button>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="给当前账套改名，如 一车间" value="{{rename_text}}" bindinput="onRenameText"/>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="renameBook">改当前账套名</button>
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="loadBooksCheck">🧾 看看三个账本都在干嘛</button>
      <view class="tip">🔒 账本封存：老账本对完账就封起来，整本只能看、不能增删改（要改先解封，解封会留痕）。三本账各自单独封。</view>
      <view class="row2" wx:if="{{sealed}}">这本账从 {{sealed_at}} 起已封存{{seal_note ? '（' + seal_note + '）' : ''}}</view>
      <view class="row2" wx:else>这本账现在是可改的</view>
      <view class="frow">
        <button class="btn" size="mini" wx:if="{{!sealed}}" bindtap="sealBook">🔒 封存这本账</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" wx:if="{{sealed}}" bindtap="unsealBook">🔓 解封</button>
      </view>
      <block wx:if="{{bck}}">
        <view class="card">
          <view class="bck-adv">{{bck.advice}}</view>
          <view class="item" wx:for="{{bck.rows}}" wx:key="id">
            <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.name}}{{item.current?'（当前在用）':''}}</text><text class="amt">{{item.used ? (item.orders + item.payables) + ' 张单' : '空'}}</text></view>
            <view class="row2">流水 {{item.ledger}} 笔 · 账户 {{item.accounts}} 个 · 分类 {{item.cats}} 个 · 期初合计 {{item.opening}}{{item.last ? ' · 最后动账 ' + item.last : ''}}</view>
            <view class="row2 bck-tip" wx:for="{{item.tips}}" wx:for-item="tp" wx:key="*this">· {{tp}}</view>
            <view class="btns">
              <button size="mini" wx:if="{{!item.current}}" bindtap="switchBook" data-id="{{item.id}}">切到这本</button>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="frow"><button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="closeBooksCheck">收起</button></view>
      </block>
    </view>
    <view class="form">
      <view class="seg {{contact_type=='ar'?'on':''}}" bindtap="setContactType" data-t="ar">客户</view>
      <view class="seg {{contact_type=='ap'?'on':''}}" bindtap="setContactType" data-t="ap">供应商</view>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{contact_type=='ar'}}">
      <view class="list">
        <view class="item" wx:for="{{contacts_ar}}" wx:key="name">
          <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.name}}</text><text class="amt">欠{{item.unpaid}}</text></view>
          <view class="row2">累计{{item.total}} · 已收{{item.paid}} · {{item.cnt}}笔</view>
          <view class="btns">
            <button size="mini" bindtap="contactDetail" data-type="ar" data-name="{{item.name}}">往来明细</button>
            <button size="mini" bindtap="printStatement" data-type="ar" data-name="{{item.name}}">打印版</button>
            <button size="mini" bindtap="trackLink" data-name="{{item.name}}">发进度</button>
            <button size="mini" bindtap="oneLiner" data-type="ar" data-n="{{item.name}}">一句话</button>
            <button size="mini" wx:if="{{role!='staff'}}" bindtap="setCreditLimit" data-name="{{item.name}}">设额度</button>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!contacts_ar.length}}">暂无客户记录</view>
      </view>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="list">
        <view class="item" wx:for="{{contacts_ap}}" wx:key="name">
          <view class="row1"><text class="nm">{{item.name}}</text><text class="amt">欠{{item.unpaid}}</text></view>
          <view class="row2">累计{{item.total}} · 已付{{item.paid}} · {{item.cnt}}笔</view>
          <view class="btns">
            <button size="mini" bindtap="contactDetail" data-type="ap" data-name="{{item.name}}">往来明细</button>
            <button size="mini" bindtap="printStatement" data-type="ap" data-name="{{item.name}}">打印版</button>
            <button size="mini" bindtap="oneLiner" data-type="ap" data-n="{{item.name}}">一句话</button>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!contacts_ap.length}}">暂无供应商记录</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </block>

  <view class="mask" wx:if="{{detail_show}}" bindtap="closeDetail">
    <view class="modal" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="modal-title">{{detail_title}}</view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y class="modal-body">
        <view class="pre">{{detail_head}}</view>
        <view class="detail-line" wx:for="{{detail_rows}}" wx:key="index">{{item.k}}  {{item.v}}</view>
        <view class="tip" wx:if="{{!detail_rows.length}}">还没有收付记录</view>
      </scroll-view>
      <view class="btns">
        <button size="mini" bindtap="copyDetail">复制明细</button>
        <button size="mini" bindtap="closeDetail">关闭</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="mask" wx:if="{{contact_show}}" bindtap="closeContact">
    <view class="modal" catchtap="">
      <view class="modal-title">{{contact_title}}</view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y class="modal-body">
        <view class="pre">{{contact_text}}</view>
      </scroll-view>
      <view class="btns">
        <button size="mini" bindtap="copyContactText">复制文字</button>
        <button size="mini" bindtap="genContactImage">生成图片</button>
        <button size="mini" bindtap="closeContact">关闭</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="mask" wx:if="{{help_open}}" bindtap="closeHelp">
    <view class="modal" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="modal-title">怎么用（一页纸）<text class="sheet-x" bindtap="closeHelp">✕</text></view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y class="modal-body">

      <view class="help-h">每天（30 秒）</view>
      <view class="help-p">1. 有活就记：首页「一句话记账」，如「收张老板3000」「付电费800」；或到「记账 → 应收」正经记一张单。</view>
      <view class="help-p">2. 收钱/付钱：在单子上按「收款」/「付款」，选账户（现金/银行卡/微信/支付宝），可改金额（部分收款）。</view>
      <view class="help-p">3. 有活在做：点单子「进度」，写一句「已切完，在打磨」，客户问的时候直接发进度链接。</view>
      <view class="help-h">每周（5 分钟）</view>
      <view class="help-p">1. 首页「今天要做的事」：该催的、快到期的、超预算的，一条条点掉。</view>
      <view class="help-p">2. 「记账 → 应收」里看谁欠得最久，点「催款清单」生成话术，抄微信发过去。</view>
      <view class="help-h">每月（20 分钟）</view>
      <view class="help-p">1. 对方发来对账明细：到「记账 → 批量导入」，选「对账核对（应收）」，或直接粘贴，先「看预览」再「确认入账」，差异一键补记。</view>
      <view class="help-p">2. 「报表 → 月底收尾」：七步走完就结账（单据、对账、差异、发对账单、小结、备份、结账），结完这个月不能改。</view>
      <view class="help-p">3. 「报表 → 备份」备份一次（也可开云端/笔记站自动备份）。</view>
      <view class="help-h">要给别人用</view>
      <view class="help-p">· 员工：设置里设「员工口令」，给他这个口令——他能记账、收款，但删改单子、看利润要老板口令。</view>
      <view class="help-p">· 客户：单位页「发进度」生成链接，发微信就行，只读、只能看他自己的单。</view>
      <view class="help-h">换手机 / 丢了手机</view>
      <view class="help-p">· 数据在云上，换手机用同一个微信打开小程序、输老板口令即可，不用导出导入。</view>
      <view class="help-p">· 口令忘了：用恢复码自己重设（设置 → 🔑 找回口令 → 输入恢复码 + 新口令），不用求人。恢复码只显示一次，记得抄下来。</view>
      <view class="help-h">记错了怎么办</view>
      <view class="help-p">· 单子：点开改（金额不能小于已收的），删掉的在「设置 → 回收站」30 天内能找回。</view>
      <view class="help-p">· 收错了：明细里删掉那笔流水，单据的已收会自动退回。</view>
      </scroll-view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <canvas type="2d" id="reportCanvas" class="report-canvas"></canvas>

<!-- 找回口令（恢复码）浮层：忘了口令时用 -->
<view class="rec-mask" wx:if="{{rec_show}}" catchtap="closeRecover">
  <view class="rec-box" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="rec-h">用恢复码找回口令</view>
    <view class="rec-d">输入当时抄下来的 16 位恢复码，再设一个新口令。恢复码不在这台手机上也没关系，纸上的就行。</view>
    <input class="inp" placeholder="恢复码，如 ABCD-EFGH-JKLM-NPQR" value="{{rec_code}}" bindinput="onRecCode" />
    <input class="inp" password placeholder="新口令（至少 4 位）" value="{{rec_pw}}" bindinput="onRecPw" />
    <view class="rec-d">没有恢复码？那只能用原口令进；实在进不去，找帮你搭系统的人从后台处理。</view>
    <view class="hobtns">
      <button class="btn" size="mini" bindtap="doRecover" loading="{{rec_busy}}">重设口令</button>
      <button class="btn gray" size="mini" bindtap="closeRecover">取消</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
</view>
